  "description": "<p>When acl:accessControl triple appears in body of a PUT or POST or SPARQL update (PATCH)  validate the value according to rules set out in <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2705\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2705</a> and <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2687\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2687</a> (ideally reusing the code).  If not valid,  return 409.</p>",
